1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,675
Ursula's Faith: a Character Pack for Ursula, the nun once possessed by the demon

2
00:00:04,675 --> 00:00:05,057
Berith.

3
00:00:05,277 --> 00:00:09,470
She fights with prayer, not weapons. She plays against any Killer at any Location,

4
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:11,208
with special rules against Berith.

5
00:00:12,033 --> 00:00:16,581
Setup in brief. Remove Weak Attack, Furious Strike, Critical Blow and Retaliate from

6
00:00:16,581 --> 00:00:17,068
the game.

7
00:00:17,288 --> 00:00:21,643
Add the zero cost Quick Prayer card to your hand, and put Solemn Prayer and all six

8
00:00:21,643 --> 00:00:25,999
Divine Action cards in the Tableau. Put the Prayer Points Tracker out with a marker

9
00:00:25,999 --> 00:00:26,419
on zero.

10
00:00:26,639 --> 00:00:31,019
Start with one Holy Item, the Book, Cross or Rosary, chosen or drawn at random.

11
00:00:31,019 --> 00:00:35,565
You may shuffle the unused ones into the Location's Items before building the Item

12
00:00:35,565 --> 00:00:35,897
decks.

13
00:00:36,117 --> 00:00:39,702
Against Berith, don't place a Final Girl meeple or miniature at all.

14
00:00:39,702 --> 00:00:40,704
More on that later.

15
00:00:41,533 --> 00:00:45,442
Prayer Points come from Prayer Action cards, Quick Prayer and Solemn Prayer, and

16
00:00:45,442 --> 00:00:46,419
from saving Victims.

17
00:00:46,639 --> 00:00:50,652
When saving Victims you must take the rewards in order, starting at the space that

18
00:00:50,652 --> 00:00:53,002
gives one Prayer Point and following the arrows:

19
00:00:53,002 --> 00:00:54,617
one, then two, two, three, three.

20
00:00:54,837 --> 00:00:57,291
Move the Tracking marker as you gain or spend them.

21
00:00:57,291 --> 00:00:59,744
You may hold more than the tracker's maximum value.

22
00:01:00,567 --> 00:01:04,816
Ursula's six Divine Action cards act like normal Action cards, except you spend

23
00:01:04,816 --> 00:01:08,204
Prayer Points, not Time, to acquire them in the Planning phase.

24
00:01:08,424 --> 00:01:12,043
Prayer Points you don't spend aren't lost at the end of the Planning phase, so you

25
00:01:12,043 --> 00:01:13,544
can save up for an expensive card.

26
00:01:13,764 --> 00:01:16,111
Each card's cost and effect is printed on it.

27
00:01:16,933 --> 00:01:20,719
Ursula can't use regular or Signature Action cards that deal damage.

28
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:25,061
The Holy Smite Divine Action card is the only card she can use to deal damage.

29
00:01:25,281 --> 00:01:29,266
She also can't take or use weapons. If you draw a weapon when searching, remove it

30
00:01:29,266 --> 00:01:31,404
from the game and draw another in its place.

31
00:01:31,624 --> 00:01:35,748
If you keep drawing weapons and empty the Item deck, take Prayer Points equal to the

32
00:01:35,748 --> 00:01:38,301
number of Item cards you removed during that search.

33
00:01:39,133 --> 00:01:43,561
If another game effect, not damaging an Enemy, needs you to deal damage, you may pay

34
00:01:43,561 --> 00:01:46,566
Prayer Points instead: two Prayer Points for each damage.

35
00:01:46,566 --> 00:01:49,096
You may also use Holy Smite in these situations.

36
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:52,185
Jessica plays Ursula against the Tormentor.

37
00:01:52,185 --> 00:01:56,648
A Victim is caught in the Swinging Blades trap, and the next step to free them is to

38
00:01:56,648 --> 00:01:58,561
cut the ropes by dealing two damage.

39
00:01:58,781 --> 00:02:03,189
Ursula has no damage cards and hasn't bought Holy Smite yet, so Jessica spends four

40
00:02:03,189 --> 00:02:06,376
Prayer Points instead of the two damage, and cuts the ropes.

41
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:11,567
Her three Holy Items each take one hand. The Holy Book, with three uses, rolls one

42
00:02:11,567 --> 00:02:14,496
extra die when resolving Quick Prayer or Solemn Prayer.

43
00:02:14,716 --> 00:02:19,260
The Holy Rosary reduces the cost of every Divine Action card by one Prayer Point.

44
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:23,535
The Holy Cross: when resolving an effect with two or more Increase Horror icons,

45
00:02:23,535 --> 00:02:24,600
treat it as only one.

46
00:02:25,433 --> 00:02:28,911
Ursula has four health and unlocks her Ultimate after her fifth save.

47
00:02:29,131 --> 00:02:33,593
During each Upkeep phase, return a Divine Action card that was removed from the game

48
00:02:33,593 --> 00:02:37,152
to the Action Tableau. If you return one, gain three Prayer Points.

49
00:02:37,372 --> 00:02:40,679
After that, each additional Victim saved gives two Prayer Points.

50
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:45,690
Against Berith, you use the Killer meeple as both Ursula, the Final Girl, and

51
00:02:45,690 --> 00:02:47,922
Berith, the possessed Ursula, the Killer.

52
00:02:47,922 --> 00:02:49,500
No Final Girl meeple is used.

53
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:52,937
It simulates the struggle for control of Ursula's own body.

54
00:02:52,937 --> 00:02:56,262
Sometimes Ursula is in control and can move and save Victims;

55
00:02:56,262 --> 00:02:59,043
at other times the demon takes over and kills them.

56
00:02:59,867 --> 00:03:03,809
In the Action phase you move and act as normal, except you are moving the Killer

57
00:03:03,809 --> 00:03:07,948
meeple. Victims still follow you, even though you're always in the same space as the

58
00:03:07,948 --> 00:03:08,293
Killer.

59
00:03:08,513 --> 00:03:12,537
And since you're always in Berith's space, once you have Holy Smite you can attack

60
00:03:12,537 --> 00:03:13,420
Berith every turn.

61
00:03:14,233 --> 00:03:18,220
In the Killer phase, apply the Killer Action and Terror card as normal, moving the

62
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:21,380
Killer meeple. You are always considered to be in Berith's space.

63
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:25,926
When an effect targets the closest Victim or Final Girl, Berith treats it as the

64
00:03:25,926 --> 00:03:30,415
closest Victim, until there are no Victims left on the board or the Finale has been

65
00:03:30,415 --> 00:03:30,901
revealed.

66
00:03:31,121 --> 00:03:34,972
Berith only attacks you if the attack targets the Final Girl, if there are no

67
00:03:34,972 --> 00:03:39,173
Victims on the board when she attacks, or if the Finale is revealed and there are no

68
00:03:39,173 --> 00:03:40,273
Victims in your space.

69
00:03:41,100 --> 00:03:45,700
The word Ursula on Terror, Dark Power and Finale cards means Berith, the possessed

70
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:47,607
Ursula, not you as the Final Girl.

71
00:03:48,433 --> 00:03:52,519
Damage to Berith comes off the Killer board as usual, and damage to you comes off

72
00:03:52,519 --> 00:03:56,049
your player board. Effects that hit everyone in a space hurt you both.

73
00:03:56,269 --> 00:03:59,981
In the Panic phase, treat the space you and Berith share as the Killer's space.

74
00:04:00,201 --> 00:04:04,188
To win, Ursula must still come back from the dead and have a Final Health token on

75
00:04:04,188 --> 00:04:06,473
the Divine Blessings sheet that reveals health.

76
00:04:07,300 --> 00:04:11,304
A few tips. With four health and no weapons you can't fight back at first, so bank

77
00:04:11,304 --> 00:04:14,233
Prayer Points early and make Holy Smite your first purchase.

78
00:04:14,453 --> 00:04:18,549
The Holy Rosary makes every Divine Action card cheaper, which adds up fast.

79
00:04:18,769 --> 00:04:23,274
Against Berith, you're always in her space, so Berith's own Expel Demon card, which

80
00:04:23,274 --> 00:04:26,151
deals no damage, is always playable. God be with you.

